{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27150","headline":"重阳 · 周贺","name":"重阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云木疎黄秋满川，茱萸风里一樽前。\n几回爲客逢佳节，曾见何人再少年。\n霜报征衣冷针指，鴈惊幽隐泣云泉。\n古来醉乐皆难得，留取穷通委上天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}